{
  "slug": "codex-hud",
  "name": "Codex Hud",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Display OpenAI Codex usage and rate limits inside Claude Code. Real-time statusline integration with claude-hud, slash commands for usage/costs/summary.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **11 commands**.\n\n- **Commands** (11): `configure` (Configure codex-hud statusline display options (guided interactive flow)), `costs-month` (Show last 30 days Codex cost breakdown), `costs-today` (Show today's Codex cost breakdown), `costs-week` (Show last 7 days Codex cost breakdown), `setup-key` (Configure or update the OpenAI Admin API key (enables /codex-hud:costs-*)), `setup` (Install codex-hud statusline (automatic, idempotent)), `summary` (Quick one-line summary of today's Codex activity (cost shown if Admin key configured)), `uninstall` (Remove the codex-hud statusline integration (restores your previous statusline)), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install codex-hud@claude-community` from `haenara-shin/codex-hud`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "command",
  "sourceType": "community",
